  "summary": "Partial refund on a captured order behaves correctly in the PayPal sandbox. A 20.00 USD card-funded order (order 603965450M1249740, capture 1G2950341L0926923) was partially refunded 8.00 (refund 83R28259SF490483K, COMPLETED). The capture moved to PARTIALLY_REFUNDED. An over-refund of 13.00 against 12.00 remaining was rejected with REFUND_AMOUNT_EXCEEDED. A refund of the remaining 12.00 succeeded (refund 8LH69773LF956593X), cumulative total refunded reached 20.00, and the capture became REFUNDED. A further refund attempt was rejected with CAPTURE_FULLY_REFUNDED. All built-in and goal-specific assertions passed.",
